<section class="page" id="page-cloud-warehouse">
          <div class="page-toolbar"><div><span class="section-kicker">CLOUD STORAGE</span><h2>云储管理</h2><p>管理玩家云储库存、市场挂单与成交记录。</p></div><div class="warehouse-toolbar-actions"><button class="btn secondary" id="openCloudRecycleRestrictions" type="button">回收管制</button><button class="btn secondary" id="reloadCloudWarehouseAdmin" type="button">↻ 刷新</button></div></div>
          <div class="warehouse-summary-grid"><article><span>玩家仓库</span><strong id="cloudStatWarehouses">0</strong><small>持有有效库存</small></article><article><span>有效库存</span><strong id="cloudStatInventory">0</strong><small>库存批次数</small></article><article><span>交易上架</span><strong id="cloudStatListings">0</strong><small>有效挂单数</small></article><article><span>市场数量</span><strong id="cloudStatMarketOrders">0</strong><small>剩余可售件数</small></article><article><span>成交记录</span><strong id="cloudStatTrades">0</strong><small>累计成交笔数</small></article><article class="warehouse-recycle-command-card"><span>内置回收</span><form id="cloudRecycleCommandForm"><input name="recycleCommand" maxlength="20" autocomplete="off" placeholder="回收" required><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存</button></form><small>命令：<code id="cloudRecycleCommandPreview">@回收 &lt;物品ID&gt;</code></small></article></div>
          <div class="warehouse-settings-row"><form class="card warehouse-settings-card warehouse-trade-settings-card" id="cloudWarehouseSettingsForm"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>交易设置</h3><p>配置交易中心交易条件和基础额度。</p></div><label class="switch warehouse-market-switch"><input name="marketEnabled" type="checkbox"><span></span>开放交易中心</label></div><div class="warehouse-trade-fields"><label><span>交易手续费</span><span class="warehouse-field-input"><input name="feeBps" type="number" min="0" max="100" required><b>%</b></span><small>按百分比收取，3表示3%</small></label><label><span>最低手续费</span><span class="warehouse-field-input"><input name="minimumFee" type="number" min="0" max="100000000" required><b>商城币</b></span><small>每笔交易收取的最低手续费</small></label><label><span>取出手续费</span><span class="warehouse-field-input"><input name="withdrawFee" type="number" min="0" max="100000000" required><b>商城币</b></span><small>每次取出云储物品时收取</small></label><label><span>每日基础额度</span><span class="warehouse-field-input"><input name="dailyBaseQuota" type="number" min="0" max="100000" required><b>次</b></span><small>每日基础入库次数，不含云储证额度</small></label><label><span>售价销毁</span><span class="warehouse-field-input"><input name="destroyRefundPercent" type="number" min="0" max="100" required><b>%</b></span><small>按商城单件售价和物品耐久计算，最低返还1币</small></label><label><span>无售价销毁</span><span class="warehouse-field-input"><input name="destroyFallbackRefund" type="number" min="0" max="100000000" required><b>商城币</b></span><small>商城没有有效售价时，每个库存批次固定返还</small></label></div><div class="warehouse-trade-actions"><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存设置</button></div></form>
            <form class="card warehouse-settings-card warehouse-pass-settings-card" id="cloudPassPlansForm"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>云储证设置</h3><p>配置不同等级的购买价格和每日额度。</p></div><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存云储证</button></div><div class="form-grid cols-3">
              <fieldset data-cloud-pass-plan="normal"><legend>普通云储证</legend><label class="switch"><input name="normalEnabled" type="checkbox"><span></span>开放购买</label><label>价格（商城币）<input name="normalPrice" type="number" min="0" max="100000000" required></label><label>有效天数<input name="normalDurationDays" type="number" min="1" max="3650" required></label><label>每日增加额度<input name="normalDailyQuota" type="number" min="0" max="100000" required></label></fieldset>
              <fieldset data-cloud-pass-plan="premium"><legend>高级云储证</legend><label class="switch"><input name="premiumEnabled" type="checkbox"><span></span>开放购买</label><label>价格（商城币）<input name="premiumPrice" type="number" min="0" max="100000000" required></label><label>有效天数<input name="premiumDurationDays" type="number" min="1" max="3650" required></label><label>每日增加额度<input name="premiumDailyQuota" type="number" min="0" max="100000" required></label></fieldset>
            </div></form></div>
          <div class="warehouse-workspace-grid">
            <section class="card warehouse-query-card">
              <div class="card-head"><div><span class="section-kicker">INVENTORY WORKSPACE</span><h3>云储库存</h3><p>查询玩家仓库内容。</p></div><form class="warehouse-query-form" id="cloudInventoryQueryForm"><input name="steamId" maxlength="255" aria-label="搜索物品名称/玩家昵称/SteamID" placeholder="搜索物品名称/玩家昵称/SteamID"><button class="btn secondary" type="submit">查询</button></form></div>

              <div class="warehouse-inventory-grid" id="cloudInventoryAdminRows"></div>
              <div class="warehouse-inventory-pagination"><button class="btn secondary" type="button" id="cloudInventoryPrev">上一页</button><span id="cloudInventoryPageInfo" aria-live="polite"></span><button class="btn secondary" type="button" id="cloudInventoryNext">下一页</button></div>
            </section>
            <section class="card warehouse-audit-card">
              <div class="card-head"><div><span class="section-kicker">MARKET ORDERS</span><h3>市场挂单</h3><p>查看当前挂单并执行管理员撤单。</p></div><form class="warehouse-query-form" id="cloudListingSearchForm"><input id="cloudListingSearch" name="search" maxlength="255" aria-label="搜索物品名称/玩家昵称/SteamID" placeholder="搜索物品名称/玩家昵称/SteamID"><button class="btn secondary" type="submit">查询</button></form></div>
              <div class="warehouse-inventory-grid" id="cloudListingAdminRows"></div>
              <div class="warehouse-inventory-pagination"><button class="btn secondary" type="button" id="cloudListingPrev">上一页</button><span id="cloudListingPageInfo" aria-live="polite"></span><button class="btn secondary" type="button" id="cloudListingNext">下一页</button></div>
            </section>
          </div><section class="card warehouse-settings-card"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>最近成交</h3><p>显示最近100笔云储交易。</p></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>买家</th><th>卖家</th><th>物品</th><th>数量</th><th>成交额</th><th>手续费</th><th>时间</th></tr></thead><tbody id="cloudTradeAdminRows"></tbody></table></div></section>
        </section>

        
